sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    accTitle: Digital Twin Build & Deployment Lifecycle
    accDescr: A sequence diagram showing the interaction between the User, Gemini AI, and the Environment across four phases.

    participant U as 👤 USER
    participant G as 🤖 GEMINI (AI)
    participant T as 🛠️ TOOLS / ENV

    Note over U, T: PHASE 1: INITIALIZATION & STRATEGY
    U->>G: Request DT Ecosystem
    G->>T: Activate Skill [digital-twin-builder]
    T-->>G: Resources Loaded
    
    rect rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.05)
        Note right of G: ENTER PLAN MODE
        G->>T: Research & Strategy [Read workflow/patching]
        G->>T: Write Implementation [Implementation Plan]
        T-->>G: EXIT PLAN MODE
    end

    Note over U, T: PHASE 2: SCAFFOLDING & CODING
    G->>T: Project Scaffold [mkdir, config.toml]
    G->>T: Code Implementation [Python, Docker, CI/CD]
    G-->>U: Scaffold Complete

    Note over U, T: PHASE 3: BUILD & ITERATIVE DEBUGGING
    U->>G: "Build & Start"
    G->>T: MATLAB Inspection [Toolboxes, UDP blocks]
    G->>T: Create Model (.slx) [Programmatic build]
    G->>T: Run Build Script [Compilation attempt 1]
    T-->>G: ❌ ERROR: Header missing

    rect rgba(179, 136, 255, 0.1)
        Note right of G: ITERATIVE DEBUGGING LOOP
        G->>T: 16. Fix Include Paths
        G->>T: 17. Fix Linking Paths
        G->>T: 18. Fix Model Data Types
        G->>T: 19. Patch Binary Symbols
    end
    
    T-->>G: ✅ 20. BUILD SUCCESS (GMAKE)

    Note over U, T: PHASE 4: DEPLOYMENT & NETWORK PATCHING
    G->>T: Docker Orchestration [docker compose up]
    G->>T: Verification [ps, logs, top]
    G-->>U: Stack Running

    U->>G: "No data plotted"
    G->>T: Debug Logs (Buffer) [Python -u patch]
    G->>T: Inspect Generated C++ [grep LibCreate]
